# NAVIS_BACKEND_DEMO_AUTH — optional local account demo route opt-in.
# VITE_NAVIS_DATA_SOURCE — optional source for the static frontend build.

# Compose sets these runtime settings.
# NAVIS_DB_HOST — local PostgreSQL hostname.
# NAVIS_ACCOUNT_URL — private account HTTP origin.
# NAVIS_INVENTORY_URL — private inventory HTTP origin.
# NAVIS_ACCOUNT_SIGNING_KEY_FILE — account ES256 private key file.
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_ACCOUNT_TOKEN_FILE — gateway-to-account token file.
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_INVENTORY_TOKEN_FILE — gateway-to-inventory token file.
# NAVIS_POS_URL — private POS HTTP origin.
# NAVIS_POS_FIXTURE_NOW — fixed synthetic POS clock for the local authenticated fixture routes.
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_POS_TOKEN_FILE — gateway-to-POS token file. Set on POS to enable the owner fixture routes.
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_FILE — gateway-to-customer token file for owner fixture routes.
# NAVIS_CUSTOMER_POS_TOKEN_FILE — customer-to-POS token file. Set on POS to enable the claim fixture routes.
# NAVIS_REDIS_URL — private Redis origin without credentials. Workloads read named Redis credential files.

# Phase ③ local fixture settings
# NAVIS_PHASE3_FIXTURES — enable private synthetic Insight and Marketing routes and worker wiring
# NAVIS_FIXTURE_SMS_ENABLED — explicitly enable the fake test-recipient card
# NAVIS_LOCAL_VOLUME_SUFFIX — append a suffix to local fixture volume names
# NAVIS_POS_FIXTURE_NOW — POS and Inventory clock for synthetic business days
# NAVIS_INSIGHT_FIXTURE_NOW — Insight clock for synthetic CCTV buckets and proposal expiry
# NAVIS_FORECAST_FIXTURE_NOW — one-shot forecast clock
# NAVIS_FORECAST_STORE_ID — store UUID for one forecast invocation
# NAVIS_PROMO_SCENE_PROVIDER — select a fake scene-provider adapter
# NAVIS_PROMO_FIXTURE_STAGE_INTERVAL_MS — local polling interval between promo stages
# NAVIS_FIXTURE_SMS_STATE_DIR — private mount for fake provider receipts
# NAVIS_FIXTURE_SMS_KEY_FILE — generated fixture draft and SMS routing key file
# NAVIS_FIXTURE_CCTV_TOKEN_FILE — generated demo camera credential file
# NAVIS_MARKETING_REDIS_PASSWORD_FILE — worker's scoped Redis credential file
# NAVIS_INSIGHT_REDIS_PASSWORD_FILE — Insight consumer's scoped Redis credential file
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_INSIGHT_TOKEN_FILE — gateway to Insight workload credential file
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_MARKETING_TOKEN_FILE — gateway to Marketing read credential file
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_SMS_CONFIRM_TOKEN_FILE — gateway to Marketing SMS confirmation credential file
# NAVIS_INSIGHT_MARKETING_TOKEN_FILE — Insight to Marketing promo confirmation credential file
# NAVIS_MARKETING_ACCOUNT_TOKEN_FILE — Marketing to Account artifact credential file
# NAVIS_FORECAST_INSIGHT_TOKEN_FILE — forecast to Insight sales read credential file
# NAVIS_FORECAST_INVENTORY_TOKEN_FILE — forecast to Inventory credential file
# NAVIS_PROMO_INSIGHT_TOKEN_FILE — marketing worker to Insight metering credential file
